				<wikidot:authorName>Photosynthetic</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>361873</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>Sexual: Grafts will be repurposed into reproductive organs, supplying eggs and sperm to SCP-879 and granting it the ability to reproduce <strong>asexually.</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>(Emphasis added.) If it involves egg and sperm, it's sexual reproduction. Hermaphroditism isn't asexual. May I fix this?</p> 
				 	]]>
